{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5b9bd8ae56cfcb63","name":"Fireblue Squadron","source":{"id":"source:reference-5b9bd8ae56cfcb63","title":"Fireblue Squadron","revision":20159,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:19:40Z","sha256":"8f0db91ec707ee4b056f61e75af547214fc61f3724542cb4eb0a9ca9071a3f6d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20159","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Fireblue%20Squadron&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5b9bd8ae56cfcb63","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Fireblue Squadron is a brand-new elite force created to meet a specific and common mission profile for the Galactic Alliance Core Fleet: subduing and capturing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". It takes its name from the intense blue-colored ion energy of its main weaponry. Fireblue uses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["I4 Ionizer Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/I4_Ionizer_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:fa21e3d664b5a48b"},", which can quickly disable an enemy ship, thanks to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:815dc6c626750487"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disruptor Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disruptor_Torpedoes","referenceId":"reference:cff0256003a07db2"},". The squadron is frequently called upon to disable large freighters, enabling ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," to commandeer both the ship and its cargo. The squadron is also used to capture high-value targets, such as an important Imperial officer or enemy intelligence ship. Its ships are occasionally deployed against civilian craft that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," does not wish to destroy, but needs to disable for any number of reasons.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Fireblue Squadron Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicles"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["I4 Ionizer Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/I4_Ionizer_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:fa21e3d664b5a48b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
